This plugin contains code adapted from bighelp-plugin
(https://github.com/promptclickrun/bighelp-plugin, commit 34f2a16938ba69185a7f5ed9fa4a963f9a9fe1b4),
Copyright the Loopdy / bighelp contributors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Adapted parts: the strict-validation helpers, the form field kinds and submitted-value rules,
the card-in-Markdown delivery idea (a fenced block carried in the durable assistant reply) and the
form request / response flow (loopdy_generative_ui forms and loopdy_await_form_response), all in
cards.py, store.py and __init__.py. They were renamed (hermes.card, hermes_card_*) and changed:
our own card schema and component set, no hash verification, forms that do not expire after
five minutes, and answers that arrive as an ordinary chat message.

bighelp in turn credits Sameer Gupta's Generative UI DSL (https://github.com/sameergdogg/generative-ui)
as an influence on its constrained, finite component catalog.

